  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a tandoor clay pot over medium-high heat.",
    "Sauté chopped onion and minced garlic until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add dashi-extract and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add jalapeño and cook for an additional 2 minutes, until slightly charred.",
    "Stir in cilantro and lime juice.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Warm tortillas by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20-30 seconds.",
    "Assemble tacos by spooning roasted vegetable mixture onto a warmed tortilla.",
    "Top with vegan salsa and serve immediately."
